        "procedure": "4,6-Dihydrazinopyrimidine (0.1 mmol, 140 mg) was dissolved in methanol/DMF (2:1, 15 mL), then o-vanillin (0.2 mmol, 304 mg) was added and the mixture was stirred for 5 min. Triethylamine (0.3 mmol) and Dy(NO3)3·6H2O (0.2 mmol, 913.2 mg) were added successively after 5 min. The mixture was stirred at room temperature for 4 h under aerobic conditions, filtered, and the filtrate was left undisturbed for slow evaporation. Yellow single crystals of 1 formed after two days.",
