        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Binuclear Dy2 SMM. χMT at 300 K is 28.11 cm3 K mol−1 (expected 28.34). After a slow decrease to ~25 K, χMT rises to 25.66 cm3 K mol−1 at 2.0 K, indicating intramolecular ferromagnetic Dy···Dy coupling through the pyrimidine (−N–C–N−) bridge. Magnetization 13.99 μB at 1.9 K and 7 T. Zero-field AC data show SMM behavior with a single relaxation process (α 0.02–0.27). Fitted Orbach barrier Ueff = 52.4 K, τ0 = 8.2 × 10−7 s.",
